  "historyNote": "#7758, eff 9-4-02; ss by #9774-A, eff 8-26-10; ss by #12372, eff 11-1-17 (from Puc 2002.01); ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.03)",
